### List
GET http://localhost:3000/api/internships?page=1&limit=2

### Detail
GET http://localhost:3000/api/internships/INT-101

### Not found (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/internships/INT-999

### Create (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend Intern",
  "domain": "Full Stack Development",
  "mode": "Remote",
  "location": "India",
  "skills": ["Node.js", "Express", "SQLite"],
  "openings": 2
}

### Create with bad data (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "A", "mode": "Anywhere", "skills": [], "openings": -1 }

### Update (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/internships/INT-101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Frontend Developer Intern",
  "domain": "Full Stack Development",
  "mode": "Hybrid",
  "location": "Indore",
  "skills": ["HTML", "CSS", "JavaScript"],
  "openings": 4
}

### Update one field (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/internships/INT-101
Content-Type: application/json

{ "openings": 5 }

### Delete (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/internships/INT-105